- Creates a `std::vector<uint8_t>` buffer to store the serialized data
- Wraps it with `hexi::buffer_adaptor` to provide the buffer interface
- Creates a `hexi::binary_stream` for serialization operations
- Uses `put()` to write the raw header value
- Uses `serialise()` to serialize the UserData structure (which will call its `serialise` method)
- Returns the buffer containing all the serialized data

